	// MECHANISM-2: Strong penalty for KVUtilization > 0.82 prevents routing to memory-pressured instances, preserving cache effectiveness
	// EXPECT-2: cache_warmup_e2e_ms < 5000
	// RESULT-2: CONFIRMED (actual=4429.7223032)

